{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301350","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301350","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1230135001:1":{"text":"제가 예상했던 것보다 아직 손님이 많이 부족해요.","source_cn":"离我心目中预想的客人数量，还差很多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CA1E2DA965FCD99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230135002:1":{"text":"적어도 보르스 여관에서 매일 접대하는 정도는 되어야 하는데...","source_cn":"我每天接待的客人，起码要追平波尔斯旅店的客人才可以。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1676AD19BF316A69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230135003:1":{"text":"물론 그의 여관이 시내에 있고, 제 여관보다 좋은 위치에 있긴 하지만요.","source_cn":"虽然他的旅店位于城里，位置比我的旅店好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5DF6DD6BACE45A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230135004:1":{"text":"하지만 너무 뒤떨어지면 따라잡을 수 없을 거예요!","source_cn":"可一旦被他甩开太多，那我将再也追不上他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8F76408F83DB0C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:旅店老板艾瑞特":{"text":"주점 사장 아레트","source":"旅店老板艾瑞特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}